{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）上午11時10分，九龍灣啟祥道與宏照道交界、近輔警總部對開發生嚴重車禍，一輛MAXUS電動七人車撞倒一名老婦。救援人員到場將傷者送院；</p><p>現場可見，涉事七人車印有建築署字眼。消息稱，當時該車沿啟祥道往淘大花園方向行駛，至宏照道交界失事，連撞路中安全島欄杆電箱及一名老婦；七人車餘勢未了，再越過對面線猛撼欄杆始停下。其間電箱傳出爆炸聲，電池飛脫路中冒出火舌，有碎片擊中一輛的士車身。</p><p>相關文章：九龍灣車禍．有片｜電池燃燒冒煙彈出碎片　目擊者：好似放煙花咁</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133398168508043264365812.jpeg/KAvOLggq6PxeqoDsY07IRSvNNCN0TKbAoje7raI3u60\" alt=\"傷者重傷送到伊利沙伯醫院搶救。\"><figcaption>傷者重傷送到伊利沙伯醫院搶救。</figcaption></figure><p>消息稱，傷者當時推着手推車在安全島旁邊的馬路等候過路，她傷勢嚴重，由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。消防員在場灌救，並檢視四散的物件是否再有火種。七人車司機和的士司機亦沒有受傷在場協助調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133379879425806336916324.jpeg/TBpcrHtNfXuGT6CzqMXK3ATIokh8m6Qy9RXsEvUV7BI\" alt=\"涉事司機在場助查。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>涉事司機在場助查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133379882315812864865243.jpeg/0SNw2Gw1kZrPGB45ql2Ro3FXBFyh7YLp56NyTOejckw\" alt=\"七人車最終撞欄停下。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>七人車最終撞欄停下。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133379885306482688563294.jpeg/nbErd1EuRcYxMeb2jlGvlqhHlUU8TcUO4q3lI-Kt5SM\" alt=\"七人車最終撞欄停下。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>七人車最終撞欄停下。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133386395939770368365714.jpeg/f66KnLnfDmShtQiRr4Y01HPvNDquqwqVkLQWFpC0FhY\" alt=\"的士車身被碎片擊中。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>的士車身被碎片擊中。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378784750211072493125.jpeg/dDtfFvhf52XjUA8nimV3P_K9haHUr5kNffXKDn31yg4\" alt=\"七人車最後撞欄杆始停下。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>七人車最後撞欄杆始停下。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133380208213102592105398.jpeg/lOdaCdzq--9_dIokH4Smtj0YRL8Pc8qJKVZklClWZJQ\" alt=\"路中欄杆損毀。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>路中欄杆損毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133380211317018624215960.jpeg/86tpr3DsmAGZb5jQrcf_LiwajS_YlzvkOOcmTTjnJk0\" alt=\"消防員在場處理事故。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場處理事故。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378787807989760605712.jpeg/l5IG-EenGtNYERMAej_kGnpdcIMdL8jdpmUwwKZlMMA\" alt=\"路面遺下車輛的零件。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>路面遺下車輛的零件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378790983208960976038.jpeg/8Sna0VvpX5h5JRyrB21aVMk08wlXmUNL6Rw6WukcOlo\" alt=\"消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378793969684480342890.jpeg/v46-XafZgml4tbFqTQtru1hqWqfgj5N31jQZjtY0GY4\" alt=\"消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378796658364416145379.jpeg/9lDqQvXcXWeuV7se97B26ntrF97og1bHeDDvAXgw7wE\" alt=\"消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378775908618240549638.jpeg/WRnxtlzJhwt-I3Naj70SpptdgYbpt9mKCgi_mgoIv5o\" alt=\"消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133378778853150720380476.jpeg/CMZKro3XlXpytDjn_gHYnUuDsmt8aRRP7FYOFOxWDhQ\" alt=\"消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員檢視散落路中的物件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133373201942843392728035.jpeg/tiawSssS2r8sJggGzmZMYD5nLYE_64L4eWXA2nllwNo\" alt=\"一輛白色七人車撞欄杆。（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>一輛白色七人車撞欄杆。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133372387073593344068745.jpeg/asv-4gn4zkMHxVtnVgj-Q72PjlWuqAB8f_mlSH_5pUg\"><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133374023258869760283645.jpeg/K3ma_Eaju71LdQy7TZDtVc_RlEMsjnf8TBhLO0wYSzs\" alt=\"馬路中心遺有火種，並冒出濃煙。（Hingkit Wong圖片）\"><figcaption>馬路中心遺有火種，並冒出濃煙。（Hingkit Wong圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133374028002889728438209.jpeg/Dq1CmHIG_TozAJpEJ2AB21uDzKYjxlEwSUhyTElIckw\" alt=\"消防及救護趕抵現場。（Hingkit Wong圖片）\"><figcaption>消防及救護趕抵現場。（Hingkit Wong圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133372384665931776869534.jpeg/eKAGXBnW52l2k-ulWJvBgYYMXbhKMbviogXRWqIF0Vo\" alt=\"九龍灣宏照道交通意外現場。（Hingkit Wong圖片）\"><figcaption>九龍灣宏照道交通意外現場。（Hingkit Wong圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133374025670725632941763.jpeg/W_v_yAqdcGkZM_aByumj1aTusrVwX0Tz-NAB0vjQAdI\" alt=\"一輛白色七人車撞毀路邊鐵欄。（Hingkit Wong圖片）\"><figcaption>一輛白色七人車撞毀路邊鐵欄。（Hingkit Wong圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-19T05:53:53.921393+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":709,"images":20,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}